{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_title", "source_sha256": "137b065814a3034d390dcac3f080b57c24bdfb89eb400fb5e71c6c915058c47c", "ja": "美希と舞台裏", "zh": "美希与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e5390b8ea43b525366b7f365cf9c34533d8682204adfc71e266d838b8f349551", "ja": "美希との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "美希在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "c445fdf80409d9eaeed92286e9ea261bc1109741f49a6b72eabc5e1f62091465", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまなの～。\nねえねえ、今日のミキ、すっごく頑張ってるでしょ？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦～\n呐呐，今天的小美希是不是特别努力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4abc3d0905d37ec2eacad1dc25373e9d84079888c5936ebd3a675289bb171c19", "ja": "そうだな。さっきもソロで頑張ってくれてたし、\nいい感じだと思う。", "zh": "是啊。刚才也努力完成了独唱，我觉得状态很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "f28fbb69a7a363dceba429e196a48880ebf85857e8998f10687c59b058109e49", "ja": "だよね！　じゃあじゃあ、ミキにいちごババロア、\n食べさせてくれる？　今ここで☆", "zh": "对吧！那那，你能喂美希吃草莓巴伐露吗？现在就在这里哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a598c70dad942764c0b7ea058f59de8878139928d8ba19d3cc1d85c71ead86dc", "ja": "……えっ、今ここで？　ライブ中なのに？", "zh": "……诶，现在在这儿？明明还在演出中啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "613001914fcf001c083e9905bb37341f1be5270d7f1c0e81794fe35ddfadbcaa", "ja": "うん！　あとね、キャラメルマキアートと～、\nおにぎりと～、お餅と～、おしるこ！", "zh": "嗯！还有焦糖玛奇朵～、\n饭团～、年糕～、红豆年糕汤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c90fccf9c06b4544937d01c03e30399ef5d2ae4466d30903a4be9ac27b3375ac", "ja": "そんな食べ合わせで……？　いや、どうしたんだ？\nいきなり無茶なこと言って。", "zh": "配上这些东西……？不对，你这是怎么了？\n突然说些这么乱来的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "85bc41f6aa4d95f944ae943ac6ee0520a1dd03d8811680037dad302583015eca", "ja": "あのね、ミキ思ったの。最近のミキ、\nちょっといい子すぎたんじゃないかなーって。", "zh": "那个啊，美希在想。最近的美希，是不是有点太乖了呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "bcde6cc9d6f166bae4d82c12f91d099d1a9b6679a1724736b2c21e0c626f7311", "ja": "あんまりワガママ言わないし、居眠りもたまにしか\nしないし、叱られたら「はーい」って返事するし。", "zh": "平时也不怎么任性，打瞌睡也只是偶尔，挨骂了还会回答“好——”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1008_p", "source_sha256": "47c76ad19fc09cab2eb2fde4f86dea8b272b68129ae3622393af93f7ee678488", "ja": "……そうだな、返事はいいと思う。", "zh": "……是啊，我觉得回答得挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "320e944ca0850708583acda63af45a9aeada26a4ecc5088cce27d7c1526ecf8b", "ja": "でも、今日のライブは、ちょっと違うでしょ？\nガマンして、いい子にしてなくていいっていうかー。", "zh": "但是，今天的演唱会有点不一样，对吧？\n该说是不用忍耐，也不用乖乖听话了吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "bde0a3be0b40cbab14c17984e1ab85ad76a5cfbb785daca771fed20bbf37e1c9", "ja": "思いっきりワガママに、誰よりも一番キラキラして、\n視線を独り占めすることだけ考えればいいんだよね？", "zh": "尽情地任性，比谁都更耀眼夺目，\n只要想着把视线全都独占过来就好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "e5949a01820e77d2e4b9e8710007c7e34e7f3a2e86e5ba18c10a8c687521794b", "ja": "もちろん、それってミキだけじゃなくて、\n他のみんなも、だけど！", "zh": "当然，不仅是美希，\n其他人也是一样哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "33205c418726d32cfca62ab97b2a9d77283e401099d54741478aa251454fed9d", "ja": "だから、{$P$}は今のうちに、\nミキが独り占めすることにしたの！", "zh": "所以，趁现在，美希就决定独占{$P$}了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9f0de54c08f10f07f0828836397fcea3c1539ae36da112787c8ce61af7ab4b8c", "ja": "なるほど……よくわかったよ。なら、美希が最高に\n輝けるように独り占めされてもいいんだけど……。", "zh": "原来如此……我明白了。既然这样，为了让美希能够绽放出最耀眼的光芒，被她独占也没关系，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "ecb14802e1a2025fbcb7500486e1effc255df007341a3d6bbe9803ff80a9def7", "ja": "えっ、ホント？", "zh": "诶，真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f0b96ee9e719d7b650cb0a56abd3a9a364691c9f012ed3e8cabff3189f2420ae", "ja": "うん。でも、その代わり、\n美希にもしてほしいことがあるんだ。", "zh": "嗯。不过，相对的，我也有件事想请美希帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "972a6a946f765f0c20e27b39ddad987d41f9d74d1bb152676c8c77211315b8eb", "ja": "やっぱり。そう来ると思ったの～。\n……なーに？", "zh": "果然。我就知道你会这么说～  \n……什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5c7019ac55917ccf87b3726c9451a9d003d021424e74d8a0a972a38572b025b4", "ja": "本当に、一瞬だって目が離せないくらいに。\n……夢中にさせてくれ。", "zh": "真的，让人连一瞬间都无法移开视线。\n……让我为你着迷吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "5bbef41c12a5026727bb5c6d30840e68383aee53945f5474281292c499540ee5", "ja": "あはっ……。いーよ？\nハニーのお願いだから、トクベツサービスなの♪", "zh": "啊哈……好呀～\n既然是Honey的请求，那就给你特别优待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_003mik_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_003mik_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "35b2497adcd74d23e173deb4c52ef70cc5cf30397b07fba59e36bdd330cab49c", "ja": "ミキの全部で、これからずーっと！\nミキに夢中にさせてあげるね！", "zh": "用美希的一切，从今以后一直一直！\n让你彻底迷上美希吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
